## API reference

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `default_value:` / `value:` | `Array` | `[]` | The pressed toggles' values. |
| `multiple:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Allow several pressed at once. |
| `orientation:` | `:horizontal`, `:vertical` | `:horizontal` | Layout and arrow-key axis. |
| `loop_focus:` | `Boolean` | `true` | Wrap focus at the ends. |
| `disabled:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Disable every toggle. |
| `name:` | `String` | - | Submit the pressed values as `name[]`. |

Event: `ui--toggle-group:change` with `{ value }`.

## Accessibility

- A `role="group"`: name it with `aria_label:` / `aria_labelledby:` (not a Field label).
- One tab stop with roving focus; Space or Enter toggles the focused button (`aria-pressed`).
